OL,3,AThick fog to create dangerous driving
OL,4,Aconditions for UK commuters
OL,5,
OL,6,FThick fog is forecast for parts of the
OL,7,FUK this week, creating dangerous
OL,8,Fconditions for motorists, particularly
OL,9,Faround the morning commute.
OL,11,FWednesday will be a day of some sunny
OL,12,Fspells and showers but as winds turn
OL,13,Flighter into Thursday, extensive fog is
OL,14,Fexpected to form.
OL,16,FThe fog will lead to difficult driving
OL,17,Fconditions through the Thursday morning
OL,18,Frush hour.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
