OL,3,AThick fog to create dangerous driving
OL,4,Aconditions for UK commuters
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile rain is also in the forecast for
OL,7,Fthe end of this week, as high pressure
OL,8,Fbuilds into November, more mist and fog
OL,9,Fwill form next week.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
