OL,3,ACeasefire extended across Ukraine's
OL,4,AKherson region, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ceasefire that began with the aim of
OL,7,Fgetting food and medicine to the
OL,8,FRussian-occupied Ukrainian city of
OL,9,FOleshky has been extended across the
OL,10,Fwider southern region of Kherson,
OL,11,Faccording to sources.
OL,13,FSeveral thousand residents are trapped
OL,14,Fin the city with no access to food,
OL,15,Fwater and electricity. On one side is
OL,16,Fthe Dnipro river, while Russian forces
OL,17,Fare on the other and all the roads out
OL,18,Fare too dangerous.
OL,20,FHowever, no breaches of the truce that
OL,21,Fbegan early on Tuesday have so far been
OL,22,Freported.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
